Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Naruto joined the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.94,0:00:01.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Akatsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.80,0:00:02.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Oh, fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:03.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,Our boy saw matching villain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.86,0:00:06.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,cloaks and thought, career\Nopportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:07.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Motherflicker, they are hunting\Nthe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.14,0:00:08.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,fox inside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.12,0:00:08.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is not a job
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.82,0:00:09.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.48,0:00:10.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,You are the lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.24,0:00:11.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,In this made -up timeline,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:12.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,he bargains for his friends'
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,safety. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:14.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,But the cloak comes with
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,suspiciously aggressive\Nmanagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.18,0:00:17.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pain calls it peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.32,0:00:18.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The village gets a demolition
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.16,0:00:19.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.10,0:00:20.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Naruto says, can we maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,try a conversation first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:22.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,And Obito?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Mask on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Accountability off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.60,0:00:26.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Absolutely excellent hiring\Ndepartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:27.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,At first, missions go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:29.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Our boy finally feels respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.26,0:00:30.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then comes the assignment:\Nbetray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:31.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Hidden Leaf. Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:32.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,That is your home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Read the stupid contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.74,0:00:34.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,He refuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.90,0:00:35.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Suddenly the new team questions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:36.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,his loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:38.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sakura is left picking through\Nrubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:39.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Some protection plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:40.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Even his old friends cannot
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:41.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,tell whose side he is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.87,0:00:43.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:45.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Two teams, zero trust,\Nabsolutely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.19,0:00:46.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,no dental insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.63,0:00:47.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,So he stops chasing approval
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.71,0:00:49.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,and chooses his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.13,0:00:50.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Akatsuki wanted a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.61,0:00:51.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,They got an argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.53,0:00:53.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Could he actually change them?\NMaybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.31,0:00:54.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is Naruto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.25,0:00:55.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,But friendship speeches cannot\Nfix
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.69,0:00:57.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,every murderous group project.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.27,0:00:58.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,Would you trust his plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:00:59.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,or confiscate the cloak\Nimmediately?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.90,Heading,,0,0,0,,BAD CAREER MOVE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.90,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE CLOAK IS A RED FLAG
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.90,0:00:08.13,Heading,,0,0,0,,YOU ARE THE TARGET
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.13,0:00:10.21,Heading,,0,0,0,,NOT AN INTERVIEW
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.21,0:00:13.11,Heading,,0,0,0,,A MADE-UP DEAL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.11,0:00:16.09,Heading,,0,0,0,,SUSPICIOUS MANAGEMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:16.09,0:00:18.95,Heading,,0,0,0,,PEACE WITH A DEMOLITION NOTICE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.95,0:00:21.64,Heading,,0,0,0,,CAN WE TALK FIRST
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.64,0:00:26.07,Heading,,0,0,0,,ACCOUNTABILITY OFF
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.07,0:00:29.16,Heading,,0,0,0,,FINALLY SOME RESPECT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.16,0:00:31.37,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE REAL ASSIGNMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.37,0:00:33.71,Heading,,0,0,0,,READ THE CONTRACT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.71,0:00:36.63,Heading,,0,0,0,,HE REFUSES
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.63,0:00:39.42,Heading,,0,0,0,,SOME PROTECTION PLAN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.42,0:00:41.87,Heading,,0,0,0,,OLD FRIENDS, NEW DOUBTS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.87,0:00:46.58,Heading,,0,0,0,,TWO TEAMS. ZERO TRUST.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.58,0:00:49.06,Heading,,0,0,0,,CHOOSE YOUR PEOPLE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.06,0:00:51.51,Heading,,0,0,0,,WEAPON OR ARGUMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.51,0:00:54.18,Heading,,0,0,0,,COULD HE CHANGE THEM
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.18,0:00:57.22,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE GROUP PROJECT FROM HELL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.22,0:01:00.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,KEEP OR CONFISCATE THE CLOAK
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:00.00,Brand,,0,0,0,,IFVERSE ANIME / FAN WHAT-IF
